      "structure_description": "The crystallographically characterized cation contains two equivalent Yb2(L)(HL) components linked by phenoxide oxygen atoms of HL− ligands and two μ3-hydroxide groups. Each component has an inner, eight-coordinate Yb center in the Salen N2O2 core and an outer, nine-coordinate Yb center in an oxygen-donor environment. Two unbound nitrate anions balance the cation."
